I guess you are trying to play wishless.
IMO such an early wand of wishing should not be wasted in this way.
This chance happens only very rarely and it is important to make the
most of it.

I don't think that even very experienced players waste such luck. They
will instead try to make a speed ascension or something more daring.
Wishless is not such a big deal.

If you had got reflection by now through a wish you wouldn't be in this
predicament.

You forgot to add one more option.
12) Wish for amulet of reflection.

If you want to keep ArtiWishless, I would recommend wishing for the
Amulet of Reflection. I know that there is a chance that you get it in
Sokoban, but you also get a Wand of Death with only two charges spent.

All in all I would prefer wishing for SoM and then wait for the end of
Sokoban to wish for the amulet of reflection.

